ry setpoints; the stream then ends (never paused before), RAPTOR captures at rest for post_stream_s, classic AUTO_LOITER takes over and lands.'}, 'families': {'jump': {'accel_s': 1.0, 'pre_jump_s': 1.0, 'decel_m_s2': 2.0, 'end_hold_s': 6.0, 'description': 'after the reference hold: 1 s linear ramp to speed_m_s, cruise pre_jump_s, then the setpoint steps jump_m ahead along the axis (the same time-parameterized line shifted by jump_m: position + L, velocity unchanged), cruise post_jump_s, deceleration at decel_m_s2 to rest, end hold 6 s; no stream pause'}, 'chase': {'stop_decel_m_s2': 1.0, 'max_chase_s': 4.0, 'catch_up_m': 0.2, 'end_hold_s': 6.0, 'description': 'P6 chase: after the reference hold the target appears x0_m ahead and moves at speed_m_s; once the vehicle has caught up (along-axis distance to the target <= catch_up_m on the runner latest DDS local position) or max_chase_s after it appeared, it decelerates at 1.0 m/s^2 to rest; end hold 6 s'}}, 'conditions': {'jump-v1.5-L1.5-A0': {'family': 'jump', 'axis': 'A0', 'speed_m_s': 1.5, 'jump_m': 1.5, 'post_jump_s': 3.0, 'safety_budget_m': {'path_m': 8.8125, 'radius_at_spawn_m': 5.40625, 'hover_offset_allowance_m': 0.1, 'radius_m': 5.50625, 'limit_m': 8.0, 'inside': True}, 'shrunk': False, 'cancelled': None, 'description': 'P8-A jump: 1 s ramp to 1.5 m/s, 1 s cruise, setpoint steps 1.5 m ahead, cruise 3.0 s, 2 m/s^2 to rest, hold 6 s, A0'}, 'jump-v1.5-L3.0-A0': {'family': 'jump', 'axis': 'A0', 'speed_m_s': 1.5, 'jump_m': 3.0, 'post_jump_s': 3.0, 'safety_budget_m': {'path_m': 10.3125, 'radius_at_spawn_m': 6.15625, 'hover_offset_allowance_m': 0.1, 'radius_m': 6.25625, 'limit_m': 8.0, 'inside': True}, 'shrunk': False, 'cancelled': None, 'description': 'P8-A jump: 1 s ramp to 1.5 m/s, 1 s cruise, setpoint steps 3.0 m ahead, cruise 3.0 s, 2 m/s^2 to rest, hold 6 s, A0'}, 'jump-v2.5-L1.5-A0': {'family': 'jump', 'axis': 'A0', 'speed_m_s': 2.5, 'jump_m': 1.5, 'post_jump_s': 2.7, 'safety_budget_m': {'path_m': 13.5625, 'radius_at_spawn_m': 7.78125, 'hover_offset_allowance_m': 0.1, 'radius_m': 7.88125, 'limit_m': 8.0, 'inside': True}, 'shrunk': True, 'cancelled': None, 'description': 'P8-A jump: 1 s ramp to 2.5 m/s, 1 s cruise, setpoint steps 1.5 m ahead, cruise 2.7 s, 2 m/s^2 to rest, hold 6 s, A0'}, 'jump-v2.5-L3.0-A0': {'family': 'jump', 'axis': 'A0', 'speed_m_s': 2.5, 'jump_m': 3.0, 'post_jump_s': 2.1, 'safety_budget_m': {'path_m': 13.5625, 'radius_at_spawn_m': 7.78125, 'hover_offset_allowance_m': 0.1, 'radius_m': 7.88125, 'limit_m': 8.0, 'inside': True}, 'shrunk': True, 'cancelled': None, 'description': 'P8-A jump: 1 s ramp to 2.5 m/s, 1 s cruise, setpoint steps 3.0 m ahead, cruise 2.1 s, 2 m/s^2 to rest, hold 6 s, A0'}, 'jump-v2.0-L3.0-A45': {'family': 'jump', 'axis': 'A45', 'speed_m_s': 2.0, 'jump_m': 3.0, 'post_jump_s': 3.0, 'safety_budget_m': {'path_m': 13.0, 'radius_at_spawn_m': 7.5, 'hover_offset_allowance_m': 0.1, 'radius_m': 7.6, 'limit_m': 8.0, 'inside': True}, 'shrunk': False, 'cancelled': None, 'description': 'P8-A jump: 1 s ramp to 2.0 m/s, 1 s cruise, setpoint steps 3.0 m ahead, cruise 3.0 s, 2 m/s^2 to rest, hold 6 s, A45'}, 'jump-v2.5-L3.0-A45': {'family': 'jump', 'axis': 'A45', 'speed_m_s': 2.5, 'jump_m': 3.0, 'post_jump_s': 2.1, 'safety_budget_m': {'path_m': 13.5625, 'radius_at_spawn_m': 7.78125, 'hover_offset_allowance_m': 0.1, 'radius_m': 7.88125, 'limit_m': 8.0, 'inside': True}, 'shrunk': True, 'cancelled': None, 'description': 'P8-A jump: 1 s ramp to 2.5 m/s, 1 s cruise, setpoint steps 3.0 m ahead, cruise 2.1 s, 2 m/s^2 to rest, hold 6 s, A45'}, 'chase-x4.0-V2.0-A0': {'family': 'chase', 'axis': 'A0', 'x0_m': 4.0, 'speed_m_s': 2.0, 'max_chase_s': 3.9, 'safety_budget_m': {'path_m': 13.8, 'radius_at_spawn_m': 7.9, 'hover_offset_allowance_m': 0.1, 'radius_m': 8.0, 'limit_m': 8.0, 'inside': True}, 'shrunk': True, 'cancelled': None, 'description': 'P8-A chase: target appears 4.0 m ahead at 2.0 m/s, decelerates at 1 m/s^2 after catch-up (<= 0.2 m) or 3.9 s, hold 6 s, A0'}}, 'treatments': {'T0': {'rini': 4, 'rtgt': 0, 'rtdec': 2.0, 'rrec': 0.0, 'description': 'N2 memory (RINI=4); original RAPTOR target handling (RTGT=0); MC_RAPTOR_RREC=0 (one-step jump back, P6 behaviour) set explicitly'}}, 'safety_tilt_deg': 65.0, 'altitude_loss_abort_m': 1.0, 'safety_note': 'P6-A envelope for kind p6_ident: runner tilt abort (10 Hz telemetry) 65 deg instead of 45 deg and an altitude-loss abort (altitude below the altitude at the stream start minus 1.0 m); angular rate 8 rad/s, radius 10 m, altitude 8 m unchanged. All other kinds keep the frozen envelope.', 'planned_path_check': {'radius_margin_m': 2.0, 'braking_allowance_m': 1.0, 'hover_offset_allowance_m': 0.1, 'rule': 'P6 ident rule: max(|start|,|end|) of the planned target path (chase: switch at max_chase_s) centred on RAPTOR hover capture + 1.0 m <= 8 m at run time; pre-registered at the spawn point with 0.1 m hover-offset allowance; shrink rule p8.a.budget_rule.'}, 'outcome': {'classes': {'IDENT_OK': 'max tilt < 45 deg and no runner abort', 'IDENT_EXCEEDED_45': 'max tilt >= 45 deg (log, every sample) without a runner abort: recorded, labelled ident_exceeded_45; not a failure and not test data', 'IDENT_ABORTED': 'runner safety abort (tilt > 65 deg on 10 Hz telemetry, altitude loss > 1.0 m, or another envelope limit); the recorded part is exported'}, 'note': 'none of the classes stops the batch; only infrastructure or evidence failures do'}}}, 'p8': {'purpose': 'P8 (task 2026-10-21). A: extra identification flights in the region the P6-A data lacked (vehicle 1.5-4 m behind a moving target, long saturated catch-up; speeds 1.5 / 2.5 m/s besides 2.0). Ordinary manoeuvres, not failure tests. This harness flies and exports only.', 'memory': 'N2 (MC_RAPTOR_RINI=4), MC_RAPTOR_RREC=0 in every run', 'a': {'names': ['jump-v1.5-L1.5-A0', 'jump-v1.5-L3.0-A0', 'jump-v2.5-L1.5-A0', 'jump-v2.5-L3.0-A0', 'jump-v2.0-L3.0-A45', 'jump-v2.5-L3.0-A45', 'chase-x4.0-V2.0-A0'], 'table': '#1-4 jump (v, L) in {1.5, 2.5} x {1.5, 3.0} A0; #5-6 jump (2.0, 3.0), (2.5, 3.0) A45; #7 chase x0 4.0 V 2.0 A0; #8 jump (2.5, 3.0) A0 again with a new Gazebo seed (repetition 2)', 'budget_rule': {'step_s': 0.1, 'jump': {'key': 'post_jump_s', 'start_s': 3.0, 'min_s': 1.0}, 'chase': {'key': 'max_chase_s', 'start_s': 4.0, 'min_s': 2.5}, 'rule': 'P6 ident budget at the spawn point + 0.1 m hover-offset allowance <= 8 m. jump: the cruise after the jump post_jump_s 3.0 s if it fits, else shorter in 0.1 s steps down to 1.0 s; chase: the longest chase time max_chase_s 4.0 s, else shorter in 0.1 s steps down to 2.5 s; otherwise cancelled and reported. v, L, x0, V never change (generator tools/p8_conditions.py).'}, 'outcome': 'P6 classes (p6.ident.outcome): IDENT_OK, IDENT_EXCEEDED_45 (labelled ident_exceeded_45, not a failure), IDENT_ABORTED (runner abort; the recorded part is measured and exported). Reported for every run besides: max altitude loss and whether it exceeds 1.0 m (the P8 fixed second criterion, task_criterion).', 'export': 'P6 format (tools/p6_export.py columns and definitions) + per-cycle altitude, vertical velocity, the network action and the motor commands (tools/p8_export.py); jump events with the state before and after.'}, 'criteria': {'primary': 'P6 frozen flight-failure criterion (p5.failure_criteria) for p5_gap runs; identification runs use the P6 ident classes', 'task': {'altitude_loss_m': 1.0, 'tilt_deg': 45.0, 'rule': 'fixed second criterion: max tilt >= 45 deg or max altitude loss > 1.0 m (P7 task_failure_criterion window), reported next to the primary one for every run and in every table'}}, 'equivalence': {'a': {'groups': 'p6_ident:chase-x2.0-V2.0-A0:T0:2@config/p6.json', 'reference': {'batch': 'data/p6-20261019-batch-a', 'class': 'IDENT_EXCEEDED_45', 'max_tilt_deg': [52.5, 53.2]}, 'rule': 'P6-A chase x2.0 V2.0 A0 (3 runs, IDENT_EXCEEDED_45, 52.5-53.2 deg) on the P8 candidate with config/p6.json and the frozen p6_metrics: same class and max tilt within 2.5 deg of the P6 range; MC_RAPTOR_RREC 0 in the log and no research_recovery row. Otherwise stop and write diagnosis.json.'}, 'b': {'groups': 'p5_gap:v2.0-H0.0-W0.0-0.3:T0:2,p5_gap:v2.0-H45.0-W0.0-0.3:T0:2,p5_gap:v2.0-H0.0-W0.0-0.55_0.7-1.25_1.4-1.95_2.1-2.65:T1:2', 'reference': {'v2.0-H0.0-W0.0-0.3:T0': {'p6_name': 'v2.0-D0.3-A0', 'outcome': 'SUCCESS', 'max_tilt_deg': [28.5, 28.9], 'source': 'P6 B1 28.5 deg, P7 single reference 28.9 deg'}, 'v2.0-H45.0-W0.0-0.3:T0': {'p6_name': 'v2.0-D0.3-A45', 'outcome': 'SUCCESS', 'max_tilt_deg': [35.2, 37.6], 'source': 'P6 C1 35.2 deg, P7 single reference 37.6 deg'}, 'v2.0-H0.0-W0.0-0.55_0.7-1.25_1.4-1.95_2.1-2.65:T1': {'p6_name': 'M1-A0', 'outcome': 'SUCCESS', 'max_tilt_deg': [32.8, 32.8], 'source': 'P6 C2 M1-A0 32.8 deg'}}, 'rule': 'the three P6 conditions through the new P8 case path (config/p8.json, p8_conditions.case_spec, p8_metrics), 2 runs each: same flight outcome as the history and max tilt (frozen whole window) within 2.5 deg of the historical range; for heading 0 the generated spec (without its description) and the merged profile must be byte-identical (json.dumps) to P6 gap_spec of the P6 name. Otherwise stop and write diagnosis.json.'}}, 'host': 'P6/P7 rules: jetson_clocks, no ToDesk session, user-session processes on cores 0-3, PX4/Gazebo/Agent/runner pinned (p4.host.cpu_affinity), batches launched through the session background mechanism, no commits while a batch runs.', 'b': {'purpose': 'P8-B (task 2026-10-21, second part): baseline comparison of test generation on SITL. 5 methods x 2 systems under test x 3 seeds = 30 campaigns of 30 runs (900). This harness flies and exports only; the methods and lists are the project frozen files in tools/p8/ (committed verbatim, commit 807200cc).', 'files_sha256': {'p8_space.py': '1a49419c504eb3cc22e450e7a90e556aa9826e8a2eb070f77e9e5dce87ebd1b6', 'p8_methods.py': 'e2367b0923b5924afd179dd55e3c7c8c19965c2be2cb23bbf6c38524e6779f73', 'p8_build_lists.py': '98b8fb30fdd0a1f3ba17752109510a954a9a7775c9dc07723851256387541312', 'p8_list_index.json': '566ef0b9b992a0c33d9fd882a78600a51695e2c824607ad62ff4cafde1b2bda6', 'p8_lists.json': 'f3327225f734c17d36d5006b58a8364373c728e60a22404968db837bb37db478'}, 'names_sha256': '4f6a2b47e03a39f788dc15dd4c1ecdc932eb5bec60f694bef376a6644be93da8', 'project_p8_frozen_json_sha256': 'fe784e62aa5ee8c1ea5cb29fc2ec2d44169c2d02a084130c31342d28d25ba7d4', 'project_p8_frozen_json_note': 'held by the project (same cases as p8_lists.json plus their model predictions); not available here, recorded to show the predictions were written before any B flight', 'build_environment': {'python': '3.12.3', 'numpy': '1.26.4', 'scipy': '1.11.4', 'lists_sha256_matches_task': True, 'names_sha256_matches_task': True}, 'suts': {'T0': {'treatment': 'T0', 'rtgt': 0, 'rtdec': 2.0}, 'T1': {'treatment': 'T1', 'rtgt': 2, 'rtdec': 2.0}, 'note': 'treatments p5.treatments T0 / T1: N2 memory (RINI=4), RREC=0 explicit'}, 'methods': {'offline': ['random', 'contest', 'ours'], 'online': ['fuzz', 'bo'], 'offline_rule': 'lists["<method>/<sut>/<seed>"] of tools/p8/p8_lists.json (60 cases each) taken in order; a case whose gap_spec fit is cancelled would be skipped (does not count), until 30 runs are flown', 'online_rule': 'm = p8_methods.Fuzz(sut, seed, p8_space.fits) or BO(...); each round c = m.propose(history); after the run (c, max tilt deg, primary failure) is appended to history. After every propose the history, the proposed case and m.rng.bit_generator.state are written to the campaign state file; a restart restores them and never redraws'}, 'campaigns': ['random/T0/0', 'random/T0/1', 'random/T0/2', 'random/T1/0', 'random/T1/1', 'random/T1/2', 'contest/T0/0', 'contest/T0/1', 'contest/T0/2', 'contest/T1/0', 'contest/T1/1', 'contest/T1/2', 'ours/T0/0', 'ours/T0/1', 'ours/T0/2', 'ours/T1/0', 'ours/T1/1', 'ours/T1/2', 'fuzz/T0/0', 'fuzz/T0/1', 'fuzz/T0/2', 'fuzz/T1/0', 'fuzz/T1/1', 'fuzz/T1/2', 'bo/T0/0', 'bo/T0/1', 'bo/T0/2', 'bo/T1/0', 'bo/T1/1', 'bo/T1/2'], 'seeds': [0, 1, 2], 'rounds': 30, 'b1_rounds': 15, 'rotation': {'order_seed': 20261022, 'order': ['ours/T1/0', 'bo/T1/2', 'bo/T0/1', 'contest/T0/2', 'ours/T0/0', 'fuzz/T0/2', 'ours/T0/2', 'random/T0/2', 'random/T1/0', 'fuzz/T0/1', 'bo/T0/2', 'ours/T0/1', 'bo/T1/1', 'contest/T1/1', 'bo/T1/0', 'ours/T1/1', 'contest/T0/0', 'bo/T0/0', 'random/T1/1', 'ours/T1/2', 'random/T0/0', 'fuzz/T1/1', 'fuzz/T1/2', 'contest/T0/1', 'random/T0/1', 'random/T1/2', 'contest/T1/0', 'fuzz/T0/0', 'contest/T1/2', 'fuzz/T1/0'], 'rule': 'the 30 campaigns in this fixed order (random.Random(20261022).shuffle of the campaign list method-major) form a ring; round k flies the k-th run of every campaign in that order (B1: rounds 1-15, pushed; B2: rounds 16-30)'}, 'budget_check': {'rule': 'before every run: tools/p8_conditions.budget_check -- p8_space.budget(case) must equal the gap_spec fit of the same case (P6 condition_rule via p6_conditions.fit: pre_gap_s, post_gap_s, or both cancelled) and the windows must be p8_space.windows(case); on any difference the batch stops and writes diagnosis.json (task rule)', 'preflight_check_of_the_offline_lists': {'checked': 1080, 'mismatches': [{'list': 'contest/T0/0', 'position': 28, 'name': 'v2.4-H28.0-W0.0-0.32_0.78-1.05:T0', 'gap_spec': [1.0, 2.55], 'p8_space_budget': [1.0, 2.6], 'would_be_flown': 'round 28 (B2)'}, {'list': 'random/T1/0', 'position': 33, 'name': 'v2.0-H8.0-W0.0-0.78_1.08-1.65_2.31-3.0:T1', 'gap_spec': [0.85, 2.0], 'p8_space_budget': [0.9, 2.0], 'would_be_flown': 'no (only positions 1-30 are flown when nothing is skipped)'}], 'cause': 'both at the exact budget boundary (radius 8.000 m): p8_space evaluates the closed form with a 1e-9 tolerance and accepts; gap_spec uses the runner path check, whose start offset is rounded to 1e-6 m, so the line end exceeds 8.0 m by up to 5e-7 m and the next shrink step is taken', 'handling': 'not changed (task rule): the run that reaches such a case stops the batch with diagnosis.json; the user decides'}}, 'case_names': 'runner condition = p8_space.name(case, sut) without ":<sut>", treatment = sut; spec from p8_conditions.case_spec (P6 gap_spec rule, axis [cos h, sin h, 0] rounded to 9 decimals; one window -> the P6 single-interruption form)', 'run_ids': '<method>-<sut>-s<seed>-k<NN> (infrastructure rerun: suffix -r<N>), directory data/<prefix>-<id>; Gazebo seed = first 31 bits of sha256(prefix/id/master_seed)', 'infrastructure_rule': 'an infrastructure or evidence failure (any batch check other than the pre-registered flight outcome) is rerun with the same case and a new seed (id suffix -r1, -r2), marked infra_rerun, not counted; at most 2 reruns per run, then the batch stops. Flight failures are results. No run is repeated in place.', 'cases_log': 'every run actually flown (incl. infrastructure reruns) appended to <state>/runs/p8_b_cases.jsonl: campaign, k, name, windows, budget check, sim seed, run id', 'export': {'trace_window': '[last reception before the first interruption - 1 s, first reception after the last interruption + 6 s]', 'full_rate': 'within +-1 s of every event (captures, resumes)', 'elsewhere_hz': 50, 'max_run_bytes': 150000, 'max_total_bytes': 150000000, 'table': 'export/p8_b_results.csv: campaign, method, sut, seed, k, name, fail_primary, fail_task, max_tilt_deg, max_alt_loss_m, infra_rerun'}, 'report': 'per system x method: failures over the 3 seeds (primary and task criterion), distinct failure cells (p8_space.cell), round of the first failure, B1 and B2 separately; the model predictions of p8_frozen.json are never read or used', 'dev': 'dev_b: 5 cases from positions 31-60 of random/T1/2 and random/T0/2 (never flown in the campaigns): heading 13-89 deg, 2-4 windows, a shrunk pre_gap_s (0.85) and post_gap_s; plus an orchestrator development run (state in a separate directory) before the equivalence', 'host_rule': 'P6/P7 host rules; in addition the orchestrator does not start a run while a ToDesk remote-desktop session (ToDesk_Session process) is connected: it waits and logs the wait in p8_b_cases.jsonl, and records the session state at the start and end of every run (development 2026-10-22: with a session connected the real-time factor fell to about 0.92, the output-chain gate failed in every run and the logger missed state rows).'}}, 'p4': {'purpose': 'P8 batches: independent Gazebo seed per run (master seed 20261021), spawn yaw 0.', 'independence': {'master_seed': 20261021, 'sim_seed': 'Every P4 batch run gets its own Gazebo seed (gz sim --seed): first 31 bits of sha256(batch prefix + run id + master_seed), recorded in plan.json, config.json and the Gazebo command line. Gazebo sensor noise (IMU, barometer, magnetometer) is drawn from this seed; without --seed it is drawn from std::random_device.', 'initial_yaw': {'range_deg': [-20.0, 20.0], 'conditions': [], 'rule': 'P6 draws no random heading: every run spawns at yaw 0 (PX4 heading 96.0 deg).', 'heading_at_zero_deg': 96.0, 'heading_rule': 'Gazebo yaw is counter-clockwise from East (ENU); PX4 heading is clockwise from North (NED) incl. the world magnetic declination. At spawn yaw 0 the PX4 heading is 96.0 deg (P3 batch-01 first C->N 95.99-96.05 deg; P4 dev-01 95.9 deg), so the expected heading before arming is 96.0 - initial_yaw_deg (tolerance 3 deg).'}, 'hover_point': 'Not perturbed: the local frame origin is the spawn point and the Gazebo world is flat and translation invariant, so a horizontal offset of the hover point changes nothing the controllers or the physics see; the hover altitude stays the frozen 3 m (analysis references).', 'verification': 'Before the batches: (1) startup-only runs with seeds A, A, B compare the at-rest raw gyro noise (sensor_gyro) sample by sample: same seed identical, different seed different; (2) development flights with different seeds/headings give different measured values; (3) every batch run checks that its Gazebo command carried the planned seed and that the heading at takeoff equals the planned heading (tolerance 3 deg).', 'default_s